---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms - Qaraye Marchants">
  <div class="container" style="padding: 60px 24px; max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 style="font-family: var(--display); font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink);">Terms & Disclaimer</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 40px;">Last updated: 2026</p>

    <div style="color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 24px;">1. Platform Role</h2>
      <p>Qaraye Marchants is a discovery and listing platform. We connect agricultural merchants with buyers. We are not a party to any transaction between buyers and sellers.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 24px;">2. No Payment Handling</h2>
      <p>Qaraye Marchants does not process payments, hold funds, or act as an escrow. All payment arrangements are made directly between the buyer and the seller.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 24px;">3. Verification Responsibility</h2>
      <p>Buyers are responsible for verifying the quality, quantity, legality, and authenticity of any product before purchase. Sellers are responsible for the accuracy of their listings.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 24px;">4. Communication</h2>
      <p>All buyer-seller communication should go through Qaraye Marchants channels. Users may not post phone numbers, emails, or external contact info in listings or comments.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 24px;">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>Qaraye Marchants is not liable for any loss, damage, or dispute arising from transactions conducted through the platform.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 24px;">6. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions, contact: <a href="mailto:support@qarayemarchants.com.ng">support@qarayemarchants.com.ng</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>